---
import Technology from '../Technology.astro';
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import SvgIcon from '../SvgIcon.astro';
import BrandIcon from '../BrandIcon.astro';
---

<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <h1 id="intro-title">I'm Bolt Guo.</h1>
  <div class="intro-copy">
    <p>
      I'm a software developer who likes figuring out how things work and
      building things I want to use. I built{' '}
      <a href="https://vizlearn.app/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <SvgIcon name="vizlearn" size={16} />
        <span>VizLearn</span><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={12} />
      </a> to make complex concepts easier to understand.
    </p>
    <p>
      My background is in frontend development. I mostly work with{' '}
      <Technology name="typescript" />,{' '}
      <Technology name="react" />, and <Technology name="vue" />. Lately, I've
      been exploring native apps, local-first software, and{' '}
      <span class="inline-detail">
        <BrandIcon name="claude" size={16} />
        <span>AI agents</span>
      </span>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Away from the keyboard, I'm usually playing{' '}
      <span class="inline-detail">
        <span class="inline-emoji" aria-hidden="true">🎮</span>
        <span>games</span>
      </span>, watching anime, or adding another song to a{' '}
      <span class="inline-detail">
        <span class="inline-emoji" aria-hidden="true">🎵</span>
        <span>playlist</span>
      </span> that's already too long.
    </p>
    <p class="intro-contact" id="contact">
      Have something in mind? Say hello at{' '}
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@aouos.com">
        <strong>hello@aouos.com</strong><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={12} />
      </a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
